{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46192","headline":"山居诗二十四首 六 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟外尘中四十秋，亦曾高挹汉诸侯。\n如斯标致虽清拙，大丈夫儿合自由。\n紫术黄菁苗蕺蕺，锦囊香麝语啾啾。\n终须心到曹溪叟，千岁槠根雪满头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}